{"id":"nfrymgb4bcalalqf83givrk3d","title":"纽约扬基队总裁莱文推动大学体育法案","originalTitle":"Yankees President Randy Levine pushes college sports bill, discusses MLB labor negotiations","summary":"纽约扬基队总裁莱文呼吁众议院通过《保护大学体育法》，警告若不通过该法案，大学体育可能面临更严重的财务困境。该法案将为学校设立2.2亿美元的基金以保留球员，并额外提供5000万美元用于女子和非创收项目。然而，批评者认为该法案未能充分保护运动员权益。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"CNBC Top News"},"links":{"original":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/12/yankees-randy-levine-discusses-college-sports-bill-mlb-labor-deal.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T15:34:31.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T16:31:33.615Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T16:31:33.615Z","category":"macro","tags":["政策发布"],"score":19,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}